# Raw Steam API page dumps: NOT committed.
#
# ~1 GB across all groups, and recoverable by re-pulling. Everything else under
# raw/ IS committed, because it is not recoverable:
#
#   _shape/grid.json   the corpus measurement every sampling decision rests on
#   */*/sample/        the sampled reviews themselves (~25 MB) - re-pulling would
#                      draw a DIFFERENT sample, so this is the only provenance
#                      the summaries have
#   */*/summaries/     the summarised reviews - the work product itself
#   */patchnotes/      the patch history
#
# Why this changed: on 2026-08-30 a stray `build_grid.py --help` overwrote
# grid.json with a partial run. Nothing under raw/ was tracked, so there was no
# copy to restore and the measurement had to be rebuilt from scratch. A summary
# lost the same way would be gone for good.
pages/
